  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "11561316-85d6-4ce7-81ae-dbbb4a8c4938",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -32,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Approve Inistate entries by email\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow starts when an Inistate entry enters a pending approval state, loads configuration, and retrieves the entry details. It checks whether the entry is still eligible for approval, emails an approver, then branches based on whether a response is received. If a response arrives, it re-checks the entry state to avoid acting on stale data, then approves or rejects the entry in Inistate according to the approver\u2019s answer.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Inistate trigger to watch the correct project/object and pending approval status.\n- Add valid Inistate credentials to all Inistate nodes and confirm the get, approve, and reject operations target the correct entry/activity fields.\n- Update the Settings node values for approverEmail, fromEmail, approveActivity, and rejectActivity.\n- Configure the email sending credentials/provider for the Ask approver by email node and ensure the sender address is allowed.\n- Verify the conditions in the approval, answer, actionable, and approved/rejected IF nodes match the data returned by Inistate and the email response mechanism.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can customize the email subject and message, change timeout/no-answer handling, adjust eligibility checks, or route the no-op branches to notifications or logging instead of ending silently."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1045b0ff-71f2-4b47-9ef6-3bcacb656318",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        528,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Receive pending entry\n\nStarts the workflow when an entry reaches pending approval, applies workflow settings, and fetches the current entry details from Inistate."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "dfad69e7-e085-4720-9724-318cc441d2da",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1216,
        416
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "## Check approval eligibility\n\nDetermines whether the entry can still be approved. Eligible entries continue with a prepared approval email, while entries already handled end on the no-op branch."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a3be41c4-5af0-4e4f-8253-0e57d246ccda",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1664,
        448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "content": "## Request approver response\n\nSends the approval request email, evaluates whether the approver answered, and ends gracefully if no response arrives in time."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "81e7fea6-46c6-48c4-a688-a3b8c4d6f5d3",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2336,
        416
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "## Revalidate current entry\n\nAfter an approver response, re-reads the entry from Inistate and checks whether it is still actionable; entries changed while waiting are not modified."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
